    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghwajoar Gideoni fuga Midiyani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata Yerubaali (nea Gideoni gil) sea fuga sean moodeayi sea niny ghang'eat sakteayda ak ghamway murdeeda gheang'deenda Harodi; nea museasooda fuga Midiyani ghwalaabwa saawa wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, murdeeda giijeeda siguura More, mida mwaangwaachi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Gideoni, “Fiisu indeawiin aasaang'a muuchi ak gaydaahaak fuga Midiyani geatinga nyaawa, adiidu ghaghwar geat fuga Israeli aba badaydeanyu, ak gaygwayi, ‘Gwalealnean geatindeanyu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa una ak girukusi iita, nea giyeeshi, ‘Gilinyoo ghabeal nea ghaboadan, dabiikta ghoah.’” Nea gwasim saawa Gideoni; ng'ata gabiikta ghoah fih sagalamnyooji diktam, ak geapuut fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Gideoni, “Fiisu gudu aasaang'a, arareang'ni ghapka heeda mida beega, ak gaydasim aba badaydaang'u, ama ng'ata gilinyoo gwayeeshiineey, ‘Siisi gajadeayeewana,’ gayghoah siichea adeayeewana, nea siichea dayeeshiineey, ‘Siisi maygoodeayeeweey,’ abeeda ea majadeayeewana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaat buuneeda gwararang'eesa heeda mida beega. Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Gideoni, “Gilinyoo ghameash beega aba ng'ushaptaanyi, gawuurji gidameeriida gudeeda, siisi gaysaja, ea siida leayda nea gwatkuy.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mooneeda fuga leaha beega ghuusiga nyaawa, ak gooheaksa geatinga nyaawa ghuusiga ghwahita fih bughalaji samwagu; nea gea siipuut ghwaleayda nea gwatkuy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Gideoni, “Fuga was bughalaji samwagu leaha beega ghuusiga nyaawa gaydalealu ak gaydayiin fuga Midiyani geatingaagu; nea suurja sean ginung'waadi gaweay, gaba siisi weah gheanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaada geadi fugiga hamita nyaawa, ea durumbeatajeega nyaawa; ak goojeakta fuga sean siipuut bea Israeli, ak gaba nih weah gheanyi, ak ghoabuut fih bughalaji samwagu, nea abeeda museasooda fuga Midiyani gwanda mwaangwaachi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedida eawa, gwayeesha “NG'UTAMIIDA, ng'eada una jeeda museasooda, aba gideaba naayiinyi geatingaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea inyas giiwali hiing'aada, girarang'aadi nea giideayeewi Bura siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda jeeda museasooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajiinya gidabaloola, ama ng'ata gajeayiin geatingaagu uurda; ak guwi jeeda museasooda.” Ng'ata ghwararang'aada sea siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda siguura Bura bwak ea ghwahita muudeanooda fuga mideawa dabita mida jeeda museasooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Midiyani, ea Amaleki, ea fuga ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ea niiduuw aba moangoachi, gawuurji deashamga aba seang'ayda nyaawa, nea ngamiyajeega nyaawa ea manda mooneeda nyaawa, geegala iseaskweanda ghuuta basooda, aba seang'ayda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwahita Gideoni, ging'ulayi, siyagi gwarukwiisa siinuut giirgweatka, nea gwayeeniisa, “Ng'ula, mukaateeyda shayiiri goobissa jeeda museasooda fuga Midiyani ea gwahisa jeemba maheemajeanjagi, ak ghwalas ea ghoabeada, ak ghwayam, bwak ea ghoabeada.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha siida mideawa, “Ng'asheanji gajea ng'uta Gideoni gil was orjeeda Yoashi, siida Israeli. ASEETA niihaak fuga Midiyani sea lugoadaanyi sean geatingaaschi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy Gideoni ng'asheegeaba giirgweatkiga, ea gidawas, gwatkuy ak ghamwaash ASEETA ak gabiikta heeda shirikareeda Israeli ak gwayeesha, “Ang'eatng'eada, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA niyiin shirikareeda Midiyani geatingeagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalach fugiga was bughalaji samwaguun ghoah geen samwagu, ak gaba siisi siyiin durumbeati geatindaanyi ea sirbiida manda beega, ea beascheeka siyiin jeesinga sirbajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Ang'ula, asina gideasinyi aniini, iyaahiti uuta museasooda, gayghoah gil easinyi aniiniin, ak eara agooga goosindi gideasindi aniini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyaaghuuchi durumbeati, aniini sea fuga eandeawi, eara agooga ghoaghuuchi aba meatkwajeega sean bea museasooda, nea gooyeenyi, ‘aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA ea Gideoni.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahita Gideoni sea fih bughala mideayi sea ninyiin uuta museasooda, aba giing'eeta lageanyeeda lugooda mida bugusta damanda siyamuujeewa fuga lageanyi; ghaghuut durumbeati ak gwanyarjeawi sirbajeega mida geatinga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaghuut durumbeati lugweegiga asamwaguun, ak gwanyarjeawi sirbajeega, ng'ata ghoang'waanyaada gheaboonyanga aba geatinda ghaadaam nea ghaghuut durumbeati nea ghoang'waanya geatinda dugwa, nea gwayeena, “Ng'uta NG'UTAMIIDA ea dea Gideoni!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaba nih miinaada aba headaanyi nea gwaneaweesa meadajeega sean bea museasooda; ng'ata gwasalda lugooda sean, hean goojuur saawa nea gwasaldeawa geeshanga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghaghuut durumbeatajeegiga asagalamnyooji samwaguun, ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA ghang'waaniit ng'uta gilinyoo ea siida gil, ghoahaak sih nuut ea shirikareeda sean, ng'ata gwasalda lugooda ea ghwahita Bet-shita, ea gagul Serera, bwak ea ghwahita moonghooda Abeli Mehola, riiksiinyi sea Dabati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda headiga Israeli gwaleabu eemoojiga Naftali, ea Asheri, ea Manaseyda sean, ak ghwaat geeshta fuga Midiyani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta Gideoni giijasoodiga ng'eanyiida heayeeniga Efraimu nea gwayeesha, “Asi ararang'eesiina fuga Midiyani, ak ghoang'waanyi beega mida madeeda nyaawa, bwak ea gagul Bet-bara, ea ghoah eenda Yordani.” Hean ghoamughuush geat headiga Efraimu, ak ghoang'waay beega ea gagul Bet-bara, was eenda Yordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
